WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
People have benevolent pavilions, and countries also have national pavilions.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:07,070
A country must do it

3
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:12,960
The emperor guards the country and the king dies

4
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:17,960
Not harmonious, not accepting communism, not cutting off the emperor, not supporting ministers

5
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:25,000
What a good person who doesn't make peace with relatives, doesn't accept communism, doesn't cut off the emperor, and doesn't support his ministers.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
This statement is the character of the great Chu

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,650
Mr. Fang’s words: I owe you a small thing if you benefit from it.

8
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:39,640
But now the princes in the court are

9
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,640
Someone actually persuaded the Holy Father to agree to the marriage

10
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:44,900
To change the world for the princess alone

11
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,760
Since they think this can bring peace

12
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:51,760
Then give their wives and daughters the title of princess.

13
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:55,080
Let their wives and daughters go and get married.

14
00:00:55,080 --> 00:01:01,580
I dare to say this, but why does it sound so cheerful?

15
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:05,790
Everyone, chat slowly. I still have business to be busy with.
